OL,3,CMont Blanc mayor tells stranded
OL,4,Cclimbers to pay for their own
OL,5,Chelicopter rescue
OL,7,FA mayor has defended his decision to
OL,8,Fcharge 32 mountaineers who had to be
OL,9,Frescued by a helicopter in the French
OL,10,FAlps.
OL,12,FJean-Marc Peillex, the mayor of Saint-
OL,13,FGervais at the foot of Mont Blanc,
OL,14,Faccused the group of being
OL,15,F"opportunists and dangerous people"
OL,16,Fwho should never have tried to ascend
OL,17,Fthe mountain in the first place.
OL,26,@wD@AOUwD@cO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/8
