PN,31402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1787006889
OL,3,CMont Blanc mayor tells stranded
OL,4,Cclimbers to pay for their own
OL,5,Chelicopter rescue
OL,7,FIt came amid repeated warnings over
OL,8,Frockfalls caused by droughts and
OL,9,Fheatwaves, making the Gouter route up
OL,10,FMont Blanc dangerous. The region
OL,11,Fclosed two refuges at 2pm on August 11
OL,12,Fdue to the conditions.
OL,14,FBut a day after, the Gouter shelter
OL,15,Fwarden called to say that a large
OL,16,Fgroup of climbers had begun their trek
OL,17,Fbefore Peillex's order was widely
OL,18,Fknown.
OL,26,@qD@YszvD@Xsz
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1787006889
OL,3,CMont Blanc mayor tells stranded
OL,4,Cclimbers to pay for their own
OL,5,Chelicopter rescue
OL,7,FThey learnt of their fate only upon
OL,8,Ftheir arrival at 12,582 feet (3,835
OL,9,Fmeters).
OL,11,FRather than use a state-funded rescue
OL,12,Fhelicopter, Peillex instructed local
OL,13,Fprivate firm, Chamonix Mont Blanc
OL,14,FHelicopteres, to bring them down - but
OL,15,Fsaid they would have to meet the cost
OL,16,Fof E95 (#81) per person.
OL,18,FThe incident sparked a row in a
OL,19,Fcountry where such rescue operations
OL,20,Fhave long been free.
OL,26,@vD@BrrvD@IqrxD@DOk
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1787006889
OL,3,CMont Blanc mayor tells stranded
OL,4,Cclimbers to pay for their own
OL,5,Chelicopter rescue
OL,7,FPeillex, the mayor of Saint-Gervais,
OL,8,Fsaid: "They deliberately refused to
OL,9,Flisten to the messages, recommending
OL,10,Fthat people refrain from making the
OL,11,Fascent or take into account the
OL,12,Freality of the rockfalls, images of
OL,13,Fwhich were published on social media.
OL,15,F"It was therefore with full awareness
OL,16,Fthat they climbed the Aiguille du
OL,17,FGouter, knowing that they would have
OL,18,Fto come back down.
OL,26,@pD@GOUwD@AOUyD@Csz
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
