OL,3,CMont Blanc mayor tells stranded
OL,4,Cclimbers to pay for their own
OL,5,Chelicopter rescue
OL,7,F"Everyone needs to understand that
OL,8,Fwhen the state pays for rescue
OL,9,Foperations, it is a blessed gift to
OL,10,Finsurance companies. It is time for
OL,11,Fthis to end."
OL,13,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,14,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,15,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,16,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,26,@oD@AOUsD@MO]
