OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1787006889
OL,3,CMont Blanc mayor tells stranded
OL,4,Cclimbers to pay for their own
OL,5,Chelicopter rescue
OL,7,FCharles Van der Elst, chairman of the
OL,8,FFrench Federation of Alpine and
OL,9,FMountain Clubs, told Le Dauphine
OL,10,FLibere newspaper that Peillex was
OL,11,Fbeing misleading and the mountaineers
OL,12,Fhad done nothing wrong.
OL,14,FPeillex doubled down on X, formerly
OL,15,FTwitter, responding: "The pointless
OL,16,Fcontroversy from (Van der Elst),
OL,17,Fcompletely out of touch and above all
OL,18,Fdisconnected from the reality of the
OL,19,Fmountains."
OL,26,@qD@`rrrD@DrrrD@FrrwD@VOUxD@RpmxD@_pn{D@
OL,26,AKO]
