OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F314A1787006889
OL,3,CMont Blanc mayor tells stranded
OL,4,Cclimbers to pay for their own
OL,5,Chelicopter rescue
OL,7,FHe then added: "Apparently, the
OL,8,Fclimbers who got helicoptered back
OL,9,Fdown look so proud of their stunt that
OL,10,Fthey're bragging about it on Instagram.
OL,12,F"I did the right thing by charging
OL,13,Fthem for the ride."
OL,15,FFour years ago in another row, Peillex
OL,16,Fsaid conditions on Mont Blanc were so
OL,17,Fdangerous that climbers should pay a
OL,18,FE15,000 deposit to cover rescue and
OL,19,Fpossible funeral costs.
OL,26,@oD@POUtD@AOUuD@SO]zD@AOk
